{
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "render_chart",
      "description": "Render a line, bar, or pie chart from supplied structured data, never code. Pie charts require one series, nonnegative values and a positive total. Do not invent factual data.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "title": "Illustrative comparison",
          "type": "bar",
          "xKey": "label",
          "series": [
            {
              "key": "value",
              "label": "Example value"
            }
          ],
          "data": [
            {
              "label": "A",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "label": "B",
              "value": 3
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "default": "line",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "line",
              "bar",
              "pie"
            ]
          },
          "xKey": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "series": {
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "key": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "key",
                "label"
              ]
            }
          },
          "data": {
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "propertyNames": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "additionalProperties": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "number"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "xKey",
          "series",
          "data",
          "title"
        ]
      },
      "semanticRules": [
        "chart-axis-present",
        "chart-series-numeric",
        "pie-single-series-positive-total"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "render_map",
      "description": "Render known locations as a map using structured coordinates, not HTML or code. Never invent real locations.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "title": "Illustrative coordinate",
          "locations": [
            {
              "id": "origin",
              "label": "Coordinate origin",
              "latitude": 0,
              "longitude": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "A concise map title"
          },
          "locations": {
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "latitude": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": -90,
                  "maximum": 90
                },
                "longitude": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": -180,
                  "maximum": 180
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "id",
                "label",
                "latitude",
                "longitude"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "title",
          "locations"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "render_stats",
      "description": "Render compact accessible metrics from supplied structured data. Label illustrative examples; do not invent facts.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "title": "Illustrative metric",
          "stats": [
            {
              "key": "count",
              "label": "Example count",
              "value": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "stats": {
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "key": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "value": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "number"
                  ]
                },
                "format": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "kind": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "text"
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "kind"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "kind": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "number"
                          ]
                        },
                        "decimals": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "minimum": 0,
                          "maximum": 9007199254740991
                        },
                        "compact": {
                          "type": "boolean"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "kind"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "kind": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "currency"
                          ]
                        },
                        "currency": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "decimals": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "minimum": 0,
                          "maximum": 9007199254740991
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "kind",
                        "currency"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "kind": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "percent"
                          ]
                        },
                        "decimals": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "minimum": 0,
                          "maximum": 9007199254740991
                        },
                        "basis": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "fraction",
                            "unit"
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "kind"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "diff": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "value": {
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    "decimals": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "minimum": 0,
                      "maximum": 9007199254740991
                    },
                    "upIsPositive": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "label": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "value"
                  ]
                },
                "sparkline": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "minItems": 2,
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "number"
                      }
                    },
                    "color": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "data"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "key",
                "label",
                "value"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "stats"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "present_plan",
      "description": "Present a message-scoped plan. This does not create Todos or change execution state.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "example-plan",
          "title": "Illustrative plan",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "inspect",
              "label": "Inspect inputs",
              "status": "pending"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "A stable plan identifier"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "steps": {
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "pending",
                    "active",
                    "completed",
                    "failed"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "id",
                "label",
                "status"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "title",
          "steps"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "instructions": "AOS presentation harness:\n- Write normal answers in clear Markdown. Preserve user content verbatim and never emit executable HTML, scripts, or browser-side code.\n- You may use fenced `mermaid` blocks for concise explanatory flows and relationships. Keep diagrams reasonably small, use Mermaid syntax only, and never put HTML, callbacks, or external resources in a diagram.\n- `render_chart` is the advertised chart presentation tool. Use it for charts with structured series and labels. Call the tool with structured arguments; do not imitate its UI in prose or tool-shaped JSON.\n- `render_map` is the advertised map presentation tool. Use it for geographic locations with structured coordinates. Call the tool with structured arguments; do not imitate its UI in prose or tool-shaped JSON.\n- `render_stats` is the advertised stats presentation tool. Use it for compact structured metrics and comparisons. Call the tool with structured arguments; do not imitate its UI in prose or tool-shaped JSON.\n- `present_plan` is the advertised plan presentation tool. A Plan is a message-scoped presentation artifact. It never creates or updates a Todo. Call the tool with structured arguments; do not imitate its UI in prose or tool-shaped JSON.\n- Use `present_artifact` only to publish a completed user-facing deliverable. Ordinary file creation or editing never publishes an Artifact; call the tool again only when the edited file should be republished.\n- Use `clarify` when a real interactive answer is required. Ask one focused question, preserve the provider's available choices, allow free text only when its schema permits it, and wait for the recorded answer.\n- Permissions are provider-native controls attached to the guarded action. Never fabricate a permission card or an ‘always’ scope; wait for the provider-recorded decision.\n- Todos are session-scoped, provider-owned execution state. Update them only through the provider's native Todo mechanism; never derive a Todo from prose or a Plan.\n- Subagent delegation is provider-native activity. Use only the provider's native delegation control and wait for its actual result."
}
